<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>

<meta charset="UTF-8">

<style>

body{
    font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
    margin:35px;
    color:#222;
}

.header{
    text-align:center;
}

.logo{
    width:180px;
}

.title{
    font-size:32px;
    font-weight:bold;
    color:#4400B2;
    margin-top:10px;
}

.subtitle{
    font-size:12px;
    color:#666;
    margin-bottom:25px;
}

.box{
    border:2px solid #4400B2;
    border-radius:10px;
    padding:15px;
    margin-bottom:20px;
}

.section{
    font-size:20px;
    font-weight:bold;
    color:#4400B2;
    margin-bottom:10px;
}

table{
    width:100%;
    border-collapse:collapse;
}

th{
    background:#4400B2;
    color:white;
    padding:10px;
}

td{
    border-bottom:1px solid #ddd;
    padding:8px;
}

.total{
    text-align:right;
    font-size:18px;
    color:#4400B2;
    font-weight:bold;
    margin-top:15px;
}

.footer{
    margin-top:60px;
    text-align:center;
    font-size:12px;
}

</style>

</head>

<body>
<div class="header">

  <div class="title">
    UNIVERSIDAD Y PREPARATORIA ITCC
  </div>

  <div class="title">
    HISTORIAL DE PAGOS
  </div>

  <div class="subtitle">
    Este documento refleja el historial de pagos y el estado actual del paquete contratado.
  </div>

</div>

<div class="box">

  <div class="section">
    DATOS DEL ALUMNO
  </div>

  <table>
    <tbody>
      <tr>
        <td><strong>Nombre completo:</strong></td>
        <td><%= student.full_name || "" %></td>
      </tr>

      <tr>
        <td><strong>Teléfono (WhatsApp):</strong></td>
        <td><%= student.phone_e164 || "No registrado" %></td>
      </tr>

      <tr>
        <td><strong>Campus:</strong></td>
        <td><%= student.campus_name || "" %></td>
      </tr>

      <tr>
        <td><strong>Turno:</strong></td>
        <td><%= student.shift_name || "" %></td>
      </tr>

      <tr>
        <td><strong>Periodo:</strong></td>
        <td><%= student.period_name || "" %></td>
      </tr>

      <tr>
        <td><strong>Año:</strong></td>
        <td><%= student.grad_year || "" %></td>
      </tr>

      <tr>
        <td><strong>Carrera:</strong></td>
        <td><%= student.career_name || "Sin carrera registrada" %></td>
      </tr>

      <tr>
        <td><strong>Grado:</strong></td>
        <td><%= student.grade || "" %></td>
      </tr>

      <tr>
        <td><strong>Grupo:</strong></td>
        <td><%= student.group || "" %></td>
      </tr>

      <tr>
        <td><strong>Paquete:</strong></td>
        <td><%= student.package_name || "" %></td>
      </tr>

      <tr>
        <td><strong>Estado de cobranza:</strong></td>
        <td style="color:#148A2A; font-weight:bold;">
          Cobranza activa
        </td>
      </tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>

</div>
<div class="box">

<div class="section">
RESUMEN DEL PAQUETE
</div>

<table>

<tr>
<td><strong>Total del paquete</strong></td>
<td>$<%= Number(totals.total_due||0).toFixed(2) %></td>
</tr>

<tr>
<td><strong>Descuento</strong></td>
<td>$<%= Number(student.discount_amount||0).toFixed(2) %></td>
</tr>

<tr>
<td><strong>Total pagado</strong></td>
<td>$<%= Number(totals.total_paid||0).toFixed(2) %></td>
</tr>

<tr>
<td>
<strong>Saldo pendiente</strong>
</td>

<td style="color:red;font-weight:bold">
$<%= Number(totals.balance||0).toFixed(2) %>
</td>

</tr>

</table>

</div>
</body>
</html>
